        "reference": "Numbers 15:8",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Then shall he bring with a bullock a meat offering of three tenth deals of flour mingled with half an hin of oil.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 15:9",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "And thou shalt bring for a drink offering half an hin of wine, for an offering made by fire, of a sweet savour unto the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 63,
            "end": 66
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 15:10",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Thus shall it be done for one bullock, or for one ram, or for a lamb, or a kid.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 15:11",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "According to the number that ye shall prepare, so shall ye do to every one according to their number.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 15:12",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "All that are born of the country shall do these things after this manner, in offering an offering made by fire, of a sweet savour unto the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 15:13",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 15,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "And if a stranger sojourn with you, or whosoever be among you in your generations, and will offer an offering made by fire, of a sweet savour unto the Lord; as ye do, so he shall do.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 49,
            "end": 51
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
